SUMMARY:**CANCELED** Teen Game Day!
DESCRIPTION:Ready for some friendly competition? Join us for Teen Game 
 Day\, where you can jump into video games\, card games\, and classic board 
 games—all in one place! Whether you’re into fast-paced console 
 battles\, strategy-packed tabletop games\, or quick card challenges with 
 friends\, there’s something for everyone. Come play\, hang out\, and 
 discover your new favorite game in a relaxed\, welcoming space. All skill 
 levels are encouraged\, and all games are provided—just bring your best 
 moves!  If you have any questions or concerns\, please contact Dominique at 
 fdiggs@dconc.gov.\n\n
