SUMMARY:STEAM Big: Squishy Science
DESCRIPTION:Join us to create your own squeezable\, squishy fidget! Your 
 school‑aged children are invited to learn about the science of acrylic 
 polymers by making colorful\, glittery\, ultra‑squishy toys to take 
