SUMMARY:All Things STEAM: Let's Learn About Spiders!
DESCRIPTION:To all youths ages 7-11 years and their caregivers: join Ms. 
 Natalie to explore STEAM (Science\, Technology\, Engineering\, Art\, and 
 Mathematics)! Every first Thursday of the month\, we will discuss a 
 different STEAM topic and further our learning with a hands-on activity or 
 craft.\n\nThis month\, we will learn all about spiders and create our own 
 bouncing spiders using egg cartons\, googly eyes\, pipe cleaners\, rubber 
 bands\, glue\, and scissors!\n\nRegistration is required.\n\nIf you have 
 questions about accessibility\, program stimulation levels\, and/or need 
 disability accommodations\, please contact us at (919) 560-8592.
