DTSTAMP:20260904T000000Z
SUMMARY:Book Babies
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for special bonding time with your little one 
 (aged 0-24 months)! At this lapsit-style storytime\, we will spend about 20 
 minutes engaging in structured learning through bounces\, rhymes\, songs\, 
 and books\, followed by 15-45 minutes of unstructured play and 
 socialization time.\n\nNote: A television is used during the first part of 
 the program (about 20 minutes) to display the words to the songs and rhymes 
 (to support adult engagement)\; there are no moving pictures. \n\nThis 
 program will be held on September 4\, 2026\, at 9:45 a.m. at North Regional 
 Library. The address is 221 Milton Rd. Durham\, NC 27712.\n\nOpen for all! 
 If you have any accessibility questions or accommodation needs\, please 
 contact Chelsea at cromero@dconc.gov. We ask that all requests be made at 
 least three (3) business days prior to the event to ensure we can provide 
 the best accommodations possible! Thank you!
LOCATION:North Meeting Room - Full Room\, North Regional Library (221 Milton Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Chelsea Romero":MAILTO:cromero@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Story Time
UID:LibCal-14288-16508948
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/16508948
