SUMMARY:Maker   STEAM Take and Make: Observe the Moon Night kit
DESCRIPTION:September 19\, 2025 is International Observe the Moon Night! 
 Observe and study the moon in our night sky with several NASA resources in 
 this month's Maker   STEAM Take and Make! Even if you get this kit after 
 the official Observe the Moon Night\, you can use the resources to observe 
 throughout the month. Resources\, activity sheets\, a 3D printed sample 
 moon surface model\, and moon-gazing instructions are included. \n\nKits 
 are located in the shelving unit outside of the Innovation Lab on the Third 
 Floor at Main Library for you to take home and complete.\n\nFirst come\, 
 first serve while supplies last.
LOCATION:Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
