 from the USA\, but she lives and works in Antarctica for six months a year! 
 She works in logistics\, which means she gets to move planes and 
 helicopters. She is based at McMurdo Station\, and her job helps everyone 
 at the National Science Foundation. Marget will be here in person to talk 
 all about all things Antarctica!  \n\nIf you have any questions\, 
 accessibility questions or accommodation needs\, please contact Molly at 
 mschaefer@dconc.gov.  We ask that all requests be made at least three (3) 
