SUMMARY:Memory Cafe
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a monthly activity for people with dementia 
 and their caregivers. Memory Cafes host activities designed to engage in 
 the present\, without the expectations of using short-term memory or 
 forward thinking. This month\, we will be celebrating Grandparent's Day 
 with a special intergenerational story time! We'll join Book Babies to read 
 stories\, sing songs\, and visit with other families. Feel free to invite 
 your family members to join us for this special Memory Cafe.   \n\nThis 
 program will be held on September 11\, 2026\, at 10 a.m. at the North 
 Regional Library on the patio near the Children's Unit. The address is 221 
 Milton Rd.\n\nIf you have any accessibility questions or accommodation 
 needs\, please contact me at dpeterson@dconc.gov. We ask that all requests 
