SUMMARY:Children's Scavenger Hunt @ North Regional Library: Library Card Sign Up Month!
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Library Card Sign- Up Month! \n\nVisit the 
 Information Desk at North Regional Library to pick up a scavenger hunt 
 sheet. Then\, explore the Children's Area to find 10 hidden pictures of the 
 top circulated children's books of 2025 at North. Once you've completed the 
 hunt and filled out your sheet\, return it to the Information Desk to claim 
 a prize!
LOCATION:North Regional Library (221 Milton Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Molly Schaefer":MAILTO:mschaefer@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Announcements
UID:LibCal-14288-17551777
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17551777
END:VEVENT
