SUMMARY:Happy Cat Month Scavenger Hunt @ Southwest Regional
DESCRIPTION:For September's scavenger hunt\, we’ve hidden pictures of 10 
 cats throughout the children’s area of the library (in honor of Happy Cat 
 Month)... Can you find them all?!\n\nThis scavenger hunt will run from 
 Sept. 1st through Sept. 30th!\n\nIf you have questions about 
 accessibility\, program stimulation levels\, and/or need disability 
 accommodations\, please contact us at (919) 560-8592.\n
LOCATION:Southwest Regional - Children's Area\, Southwest Regional Library (3605 Shannon Rd)
