BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260916T163000Z
DTEND:20260916T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260916T000000Z
SUMMARY:Testers & Tasters Cookbook Club
DESCRIPTION:\n\nPLEASE SEE BELOW FOR FOOD SAFETY NOTICE:\n\n\n\nTesters & 
 Tasters Cookbook Club is a place to talk about food and cooking!\n\nCome 
 share your experiments\, experiences\, triumphs\, and tragedies.\n\nIn 
 September we will be celebrating the culinary traditions of the Middle 
 East! \n\nThere will be several cookbooks available for browsing at the 
 North Regional Library information desk\, but you can get your recipe from 
 any cookbook or other source.\n\nWhen you know the name of the dish you'll 
 be bringing\, please email the name and source to etobias@dconc.gov.\n\nAnd 
 don't forget some containers for leftovers!\n\nQuestions? Email 
 etobias@dconc.gov or call 919-560-0140.\n\nRegistration closes 24 hours 
 before the meeting\, but email me if you've missed the deadline and still 
 want to come.\n\nHappy Cooking to all!\n\n\n\nAll in-person programming is 
 subject to change or cancellation based on current COVID conditions.\n\n 
 \n\nFOOD SAFETY NOTICE:\n\nBecause of recent local health alerts regarding 
 Cryptosporidium\, the library is putting temporary safety protocols in 
 place for our meetings. These precautions will help ensure that everyone 
 stays healthy.\n\nPlease read and follow these guidelines:\n\nHealth 
 Check:\nIf you or anyone in your household has had any gastrointestinal 
 illness within the past two weeks\, please avoid preparing food. You are 
 still very welcome to attend and chat!\n\nHand Hygiene:\nPlease wash your 
 hands thoroughly with soap and warm water before preparing food. (Hand 
 sanitizers do not kill this parasite.)\n\nNo Raw Produce:\nPlease avoid 
 bringing dishes that include raw produce. Exceptions may include fruits or 
 vegetables with a firm rind or peel that can be vigorously scrubbed and 
 then peeled completely. Examples: cucumber\, melon\, and citrus 
 fruits.\n\nThank you for helping keep everyone safe while we share our 
 mutual love of cooking!\n\n\n\n
LOCATION:North Meeting Room - Full Room\, North Regional Library (221 Milton Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Emily Tobias":MAILTO:etobias@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Book Club, Food & Cooking
UID:LibCal-14288-15946883
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/15946883
