SUMMARY:Meet Me at the Prancing Pony Book Club- The Fellowship of the Ring
DESCRIPTION: Whether you’re returning to Middle-earth or visiting for the 
 first time\, join us at Boxyard RTP and we’ll enjoy the classic adventure 
 together—one chapter at a time.\n\nRegistered participants will receive a 
 copy of the book to keep. Registrants will get an email with directions on 
 how to pick up their books at the South Regional Library. Come to all three 
 and you will have received a complete boxed set of books! No-shows will not 
 be eligible for free copies of the books for subsequent meetings. One 
 registration per name/email. If you have questions\, please contact Jessica 
 at jllundin@dconc.gov.  \n\nWednesday\, September 16th - The Fellowship of 
 the Ring\n\nWednesday\, October 21st- The Two Towers. Registration opens 
 Wednesday\, September 16th at 7:30 pm\n\nWednesday\, November 18th - The 
 Return of the King. Registration opens Wednesday\, October 21st at 7:30 pm. 
 \n\nWe will meet at:\n\nBoxyard RTP\n\n900 Park Offices\n\nResearch 
 Triangle Park\, NC 27709\n\n\n\nThe book club meets outside\, so dress for 
 the weather! Our table is located next to RTP Uncorked and the elevator\, 
 near the dog park. If you've found a table reserved for book club\, you're 
 in the right place!\n\nYou can earn an extra entry into the One Walk to 
 Rule Them All grand prize drawing by attending this program with submission 
 of a completed tracker.\n\nThis program is made possible through the 
 generosity of the Friends of the Durham Library and in partnership with 
 Boxyard RTP.
LOCATION:Offsite
ORGANIZER;CN="Jessica L.":MAILTO:jllundin@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Book Club, Friends of the Durham Library, One Walk
