 Information Desk at North Regional Library to pick up a scavenger hunt 
 sheet. Then\, explore the Children's Area to find 10 hidden pictures of the 
 top circulated children's books of 2025 at North. Once you've completed the 
 hunt and filled out your sheet\, return it to the Information Desk to claim 
 a prize!
